    %% Hierarchy
    CodeGraphActorBase --> SolutionActor
    CodeGraphActorBase --> ProjectActor
    CodeGraphActorBase --> FileActor
    CodeGraphActorBase --> ClassActor
    CodeGraphActorBase --> MethodActor
    CodeGraphActorBase --> ComprehensionActor
    CodeGraphActorBase --> EmbeddingStoreActor
    SolutionActor -->|contains| ProjectActor
    ProjectActor -->|contains| FileActor
    FileActor -->|contains| ClassActor
    ClassActor -->|contains| MethodActor

    %% Agent dependencies
    IndexerAgent -->|indexes| EmbeddingStoreActor
    IndexerAgent -->|traverses| CodeGraphActorBase
    EmbeddingCoordinatorAgent -->|triggers| IndexerAgent
    EmbeddingCoordinatorAgent -->|tracks state for| EmbeddingStoreActor
    SearchAgent -->|queries| EmbeddingStoreActor
    SearchAgent -->|ensures ready via| EmbeddingCoordinatorAgent
    SearchAgent -->|resolves| IIntentResolver
    QueryAgent -->|delegates| SearchAgent
    QueryAgent -->|asks| LLMAgent
    RefactorAgent -->|delegates| SearchAgent
    RefactorAgent -->|asks| LLMAgent
    RefactorAgent -->|delegates| CoderAgent
    CodeReviewerAgent -->|uses| ILLMClient
    GitWatcherAgent -->|creates| SnapshotService
    IntentDetectionAgent -->|uses| ILLMClient
    TestPlannerAgent -->|uses| SnapshotDiffService

    %% Analyzer usage
    FileActor -->|uses| AnalyzerRegistry
    RoslynCodeAnalyzer -->|uses| Roslyn
    LLMAnalyzer -->|uses| ILLMClient

    %% Embeddings
    OllamaEmbeddingGen -->|calls| Ollama
    EmbeddingStoreActor -->|uses| IVectorStore

    %% Persistence
    FileSystemStorage -->|reads/writes| FileSystem
    SnapshotService -->|reads/writes| FileSystem

    %% LLM
    OllamaLlmClient -->|calls| Ollama
    LlmResolver -->|uses| ILLMClient

    %% Core
    CodeGraphActorBase -.->|implements| CoreInterfaces
    IndexerAgent -.->|extends| AgentsAgent
    EmbeddingCoordinatorAgent -.->|extends| AgentsAgent
    SearchAgent -.->|extends| AgentsAgent
    QueryAgent -.->|extends| AgentsAgent
    RefactorAgent -.->|extends| AgentsAgent
